tist on August 13, 2023, with the digital single \"Drive5\" and released his first single album Traveling Fish on June 20, 2024. Hwiyoung trained to be a k-pop idol and performer in the talent company FNC Entertainment's rookie training program Neoz School. In 2016, he competed in the nine-member dance group NEOZ Dance on the Mnet survival reality show d.o.b.: Dance or Band, where he and his group mates competed for a chance to debut as FNC's first boy dance group.","title":"Hwiyoung","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hwiyoung"}},"Q65832560":{"id":"Q65832560","name":"Kim Yo-han","ko":"김요한","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Yohan"],"birth":"1999-09-22","death":"","birthplace":"Jungnang District","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"2019","agencies":[{"name":"Swing Entertainment","id":"Q65266336","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Oui Entertainment","id":"Q67934408","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q65665588","name":"X1","start":"2018","end":"2020"},{"id":"Q97191757","name":"WEi","start":"2020","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/y_haa.n/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/230e329f-4a6e-4a34-921f-a274d456a01e"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Yo-han, also known by the mononym Yohan (요한), is a South Korean singer and actor. He is a member of the boy group WEi and a former member of boy group X1, finishing first on Produce X 101. He made his solo debut with the digital single \"No More\" on August 25, 2020. He made his acting debut in the romantic comedy A Love So Beautiful.","title":"Kim Yo-han","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Yo-han"}},"Q67983984":{"id":"Q67983984","name":"Jang Se-bin","ko":"장세빈","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1996-04-24","death":"","birthplace":"","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q22098485","name":"Snuper","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q107502104",